{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "definitions": [
    {
      "id": "base:event_ch01_ref_opening",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "开局·杂役晨点",
      "trigger": "manual",
      "once": true,
      "conditions": [],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "青云宗外围资源点。锣声未绝，主管已在路上。你们三人仍是杂役弟子：白天交差，夜里才有一点属于自己的缝隙。\n\n【测试三任务】巡视农田 → 三人分派 → 树林伐木。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "accept_yoke",
              "text": "知道了，开始巡视",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "event:ch01_ref_opening_seen"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "story:ch01_phase_awaken"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_ch01_ref_miner_grumble",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "矿洞·杂役闲话",
      "trigger": "onExplore",
      "locationId": "base:loc_ref_mine",
      "once": true,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "storyFlag",
          "id": "quest:ch01_ref_dispatch_done"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "矿洞口有人抱怨配额又加了。三人分派之后，这类闲话才会冒出来。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "listen",
              "text": "听几句再走",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "event:ch01_ref_miner_met"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "pass",
              "text": "不想惹事",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "event:ch01_ref_miner_passed"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_jiang_lao_intro",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·闲谈",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "missingFlag",
          "id": "story:jiang_lao_met"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "泉边坐着一位须发花白的老人，膝上摆着一块磨得发亮的石板棋盘。\n\n「年轻人，别光顾着交差。老朽这辈子没别的癖好，就爱摆弄这几子。」他抬眼看你，「若你也有兴致，改日过来与我下一盘。赢我三次——嘿嘿，老朽便把压箱底的东西传给你。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "accept",
              "text": "好，日后陪您下几盘。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "story:jiang_lao_met"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_jiang_lao_chess"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "later",
              "text": "改日再来。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "setFlag",
                  "id": "story:jiang_lao_met"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_jiang_lao_chess"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_jiang_lao_play",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·邀弈",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:jiang_lao_met"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questActive",
          "id": "base:quest_jiang_lao_chess"
        },
        {
          "kind": "missingDailyFlag",
          "id": "daily:jiang_lao_chess"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "将老拍拍石板：「来一盘？今日一局，明日再来。老朽不催你天天到场——只是赢满三次，东西才给你。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "play",
              "text": "对弈。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "startMinigame",
                  "id": "ticTacToe"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "pass",
              "text": "今日先不下。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_jiang_lao_played_today",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·今日已弈",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:jiang_lao_met"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questActive",
          "id": "base:quest_jiang_lao_chess"
        },
        {
          "kind": "hasDailyFlag",
          "id": "daily:jiang_lao_chess"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「今日已过招了。」将老收起棋子，「明日再来。老朽不缺闲工夫。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ack",
              "text": "改日再来。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_jiang_lao_ready_claim",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·传承在即",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "questCompleted",
          "id": "base:quest_jiang_lao_chess"
        },
        {
          "kind": "missingFlag",
          "id": "quest:jiang_lao_chess_done"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "将老抚须大笑：「三次了！老朽认了。去任务日志把秘籍与开山拳秘本领走——入了炼气再研读，莫要浪费。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ack",
              "text": "多谢将老。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "topicText": "",
      "onceScope": "global"
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_jiang_lao_after",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·闲话",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "quest:jiang_lao_chess_done"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "step_001",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "step_001",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「东西给你了，棋还是可以下的。」将老笑眯眯，「不过老规矩：一日一局。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "chat",
              "text": "再陪您坐坐。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
